<SiteLayout bodyClass="site-refined"><Fragment slot="head"><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Off-market homes in Hertfordshire | Emma Siddons</title><meta name="description" content="Looking beyond the property portals? I help buyers explore off-market and pre-market homes in Hertfordshire through local knowledge and personal connections."><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#344d3d"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><link rel="canonical" href="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/off-market-homes-hertfordshire/"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Emma Siddons"><meta property="og:title" content="Off-market homes in Hertfordshire | Emma Siddons"><meta property="og:description" content="Looking beyond the property portals? I help buyers explore off-market and pre-market homes in Hertfordshire through local knowledge and personal connections."><meta property="og:url" content="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/off-market-homes-hertfordshire/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://emma-siddons-admin.tight-darkness-d12f.workers.dev/images/country-home.jpg"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="A stone country home and garden"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/BaseLayout.B6McQ5pf.css"></Fragment> <a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a> <SiteHeader />  <main id="main"> <section class="page-intro inset-banner"> <div class="page-intro__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Off-market homes in Hertfordshire</p><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1>Your next home may not be on a property portal.</h1><div class="page-intro__lead"> <p>Some homes change hands quietly, without ever being advertised publicly. I help you explore those possibilities alongside the open market.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Discuss your off-market search<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a> </div></div> <div class="page-intro__media"><img src="/images/emma-at-home-960.webp" srcset="/images/emma-at-home-480.webp 480w, /images/emma-at-home-960.webp 960w, /images/emma-at-home-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Emma outside a country house with her search notes" width="1080" height="721" fetchpriority="high"></div> </section> <section class="editorial editorial-grid service-content-cards"><div><p class="eyebrow">Looking beyond the listings</p><h2>What does off-market mean?</h2><p>An off-market home is offered privately, rather than advertised to everyone. A seller may value discretion, want to explore interest before launching, or prefer a quieter sale.</p><p>A pre-market opportunity is a little different: the property may be due to launch publicly, but an agent is already speaking to suitable buyers.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">My local approach</p><h2>Conversations open doors</h2><p>I draw on relationships with local agents, word of mouth and direct approaches to homeowners. A clear brief helps me explain what you are looking for and recognise an opportunity that could fit.</p><p>Hertfordshire is my main focus. I also help buyers searching in west Essex and South Cambridgeshire.</p><a class="text-link" href="/areas-covered/">Explore the areas I cover →</a></div></section> <section class="sage-panel considered-search"><div class="editorial"><div class="considered-search__heading"><p class="eyebrow">A considered search</p><h2>The right fit matters more than the label</h2></div><div class="considered-search__body"><p>Off-market does not automatically mean better value, and it does not guarantee an easier purchase. I look carefully at each home, its price and its suitability for you, whether it is being sold privately or openly.</p><p>Private opportunities change with the market and your brief. I cannot promise a particular property will be available, but I can help you search more widely and make an informed decision.</p><a class="button button--outline" href="/guides/finding-off-market-homes/">Read my off-market guide<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div></section> <section class="editorial"><p class="eyebrow">Your questions</p><h2>A little more about buying privately</h2><details class="faq"><summary>Can I see a list of off-market properties?</summary><p>Private sellers often do not want their homes advertised. I discuss relevant opportunities with clients individually, based on their search brief and the seller’s wishes.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Do I need to be ready to buy?</summary><p>It helps to be clear about your budget, timing and buying position. We can discuss these at the start so I can approach opportunities with a realistic understanding of your circumstances.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Will you also look at homes on the open market?</summary><p>Yes. My search is led by what suits you. I consider publicly marketed homes as well as private and pre-market opportunities.</p></details></section> <section class="contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"> <div class="contact__copy"><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s talk about your next home</h2><p>Tell me what you are looking for, and I’ll explain how I can help.</p></div> <div class="contact__links"><a href="tel:+447702630983"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-3 2a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l2-3 5 2v4c0 1-1 2-2 2C10 21 3 14 3 5c0-1 1-2 2-2Z"></path></svg>07702 630983</a><a href="mailto:info@emmasiddons.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3ZM3 6l9 7 9-7"></path></svg>info@emmasiddons.com</a></div> </section> </main> <SiteFooter /> </SiteLayout>